# ─── Agent local state ────────────────────────────────────
# .agents/local/ is the personal overlay: same shape as .agents/ (skills/,
# mcp/servers.json, AGENTS.md), rendered into your harnesses on this machine
# only, never absorbed into the canon, never committed.
/.agents/local/
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/

# ─── Generated agent adapters ─────────────────────────────
# Rendered per checkout from .agents/ by .agents/sync.py; never hand-edited
# or committed. Keep in step with sync.py's renderers — `sync.py check` fails
# if a renderer output is unignored or tracked.
/CLAUDE.md
/GEMINI.md
/.mcp.json
/.claude/skills/
/.codebuddy/skills/
/.gemini/settings.json
